  "note": "[N] nasqret/z-in-q-lean, a definition; through its dependency's ZInQ.polePoly: [N]'s own ManuscriptV15.Arithmetic.pole defines Phi with [M]'s Q_pole, but Q_pole and S_0 have no standalone definition (inline, S_0 only inside PoleCompleteness). The claims that m is a signed divisor of 2730, that a zero gives points on E_e and E_{eH}, and the degree 75 are not stated for this polynomial; ndep's polePoly, which [N]'s bounded tree uses, has the different curves x+l.",
